# This is a placeholder file.
#
# The actual ICD-10 code embeddings are stored in S3:
#   s3://meridian-ml-artifacts/embeddings/icd10_embeddings_v2.npy
#
# The embeddings were generated by training Word2Vec on sequences
# of ICD-10 codes from patient encounter histories.
# See: notebooks/icd10_embedding_training.py (in the ml-experiments repo)
#
# Shape: (73000, 128) - 73k ICD-10 codes, 128-dim embeddings
# Size: ~35MB
#
# To download:
#   aws s3 cp s3://meridian-ml-artifacts/embeddings/icd10_embeddings_v2.npy data/
#
# The embeddings are used optionally in the patient similarity model
# to replace the binary ICD-10 presence/absence features with
# learned representations. In practice, the improvement over
# binary features was marginal (~2% on similarity benchmarks)
# so we don't use them in production yet.
